elative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What is the age limit for <strong>IOCL Apprentice </strong><strong>Bharti 2025</strong>?</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>IOCL Apprentice </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bharti 2025</strong></span>\u00a0is as follows:</span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 14pt;\">The <span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum age <strong>18 Years &amp;</strong> The Maximum Age Is <strong>24 Years</strong> as on <strong>31 January 2025.</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>IOCL Apprentice </strong></span><strong>Vacancy 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:\u00a0 </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For trades like Electrician, Fitter, Mechanic, Instrumentation, etc., candidates typically need to have a <strong>Class 10th (Matriculation) with ITI (Industrial Training Institute)</strong> in the respective trade from a recognized board or institution.</span></li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Graduate Apprentices</strong>: A <strong>Bachelors\u2019 Degree</strong> in any stream (like BA, B.Com, B.Sc, etc.) from a recognized university.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Technician Apprentices</strong>: <strong>Diploma</strong> in Engineering in the respective branch from a recognized institution.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>IOCL</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>IOCL</strong> is https://iocl.com/</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-15050 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"635\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/images-1-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/images-1-1.jpg 1020w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/images-1-1-300x187.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/images-1-1-768x478.jpg 768w\" width=\"1020\"/></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download English Vocab App</a></strong></p>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"1817ca6cf1cbf46b17d86089-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7